Description: scrollable-tiling Wayland compositor (Lulo OS build)
 Windows are arranged in columns on an infinite strip going to the right.
 Opening a new window never causes existing windows to resize.
 .
 This is Lulo OS's build of the unmodified upstream niri release, made
 because niri is not in the Ubuntu archive. It installs the same files as
 upstream's own packaging: the compositor, niri-session, the niri.service
 and niri-shutdown.target user units, the session entry, the portal
 preferences, and shell completions.
